    ∃ c ∈ copies, c.2.1 ≤ 0x800 + i ∧ 0x800 + i < c.2.1 + 4 * c.2.2 ∧
      0x800 + i - c.2.1 + c.1 = 0x2650 + Ref.witnessSrc i := by
  unfold Ref.witnessSrc Ref.sigLayerOff Ref.witLayerOff Ref.witCounters
  rcases (show i < 2480 ∨ (2480 + 752 * 0 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 0 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 0 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 0 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 1 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 1 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 1 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 1 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 2 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 2 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 2 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 2 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 3 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 3 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 3 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 3 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 4 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 4 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 4 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 4 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 5 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 5 + 4 * 188) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 5 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 5 + 4) ∨ (2480 + 752 * 6 ≤ i ∧ i < 2480 + 752 * 6 + 4 * 184) ∨ (7728 + 4 * 6 ≤ i ∧ i < 7728 + 4 * 6 + 4) by omega) with h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h | h
  · refine ⟨(9808, 2048, 620), by simp [copies], ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> dsimp only <;> (try split_ifs) <;> omega
